# Icon vendoring manifest, consumed by scripts/sync-icons.sh.
#
# Format:  <destination under crates/nyaterm-app/assets>  <TAB>  <source spec>
#
# Source specs:
#   md:<variant>/<file>   @material-design-icons/svg  (Apache-2.0)
#   si:<slug>.svg         simple-icons                (CC0-1.0)
#   fa:<style>/<file>     @fortawesome/fontawesome-free svgs/  (CC BY 4.0)
#   vsc:<file>            @vscode/codicons src/icons/ (CC BY 4.0)
#   rmx:<dir>/<file>      remixicon icons/            (Apache-2.0)
#   local-svg:<rel>       temp/nyaterm-tauri/public/icons/<rel>, cleaned + resized
#   local-png:<rel>       ditto, but the base64 payload is extracted to a real PNG
#   keep                  hand-authored here; the script must not touch it
#
# Destination prefix encodes the render mode and is enforced by tests in
# crates/nyaterm-app/src/assets.rs:
#   icons/**  monochrome, painted with svg() + text_color (all paint discarded)
#   color/**  full color, painted with img() (cannot be tinted)
#
# Pinned upstream versions live in scripts/sync-icons.sh.

# --- Shell chrome -----------------------------------------------------------
icons/logo.svg	keep
