# --- Import-source brand logos ----------------------------------------------
# These upstream "SVGs" are base64 PNGs in an SVG wrapper. GPUI builds resvg
# without `raster-images`, so they render blank; the payload is extracted to a
# real PNG and painted with img(). Only the three importers the app implements
# are vendored.
color/brand/mobaxterm.png	local-png:brands/MobaXterm.svg
color/brand/windterm.png	local-png:brands/WindTerm.svg
color/brand/xshell.png	local-png:brands/Xshell.svg
